00:58:20.540 --> 00:58:27.660
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia who said this, when he discovered that i'd bought all that new equipment for the studio without telling him--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理层由托里·马拉蒂亚监管，他发现了我在没告诉他的情况下为工作室购买了所有这些新设备后说了这样一句话——

00:58:27.660 --> 00:58:29.030
<v Dan Savage>Honey, what is this?
<v Dan Savage>甜心，这是什么？

00:58:29.030 --> 00:58:30.540
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。

00:58:30.540 --> 00:58:32.820
<v Dan Savage>Well, how did this get in your closet, then?
<v Dan Savage>那么这东西是怎么进你壁橱的？

00:58:32.820 --> 00:58:53.960
